  "description": "Material 3 (Material You) for WPF: a runtime theme (M3Theme) that generates the full M3 color-role scheme from one seed color (HCT) and publishes it as live DynamicResource brushes so the whole UI recolors on the fly, plus a set of themed M3 controls (filled/tonal/outlined/text buttons, text field, chips, menus, tooltip, scrollbar, progress, card, expander), an icon-set-agnostic M3Icon, and motion helpers. Built on Material3.Core.",
